cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use acqdrift in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "acqdrift: pre-flight quality control for grouped imaging sessions"
abstract: >-
  Detects whether acquisition order and instrument drift are confounded with
  experimental group in grouped imaging experiments, before any biological
  conclusion is drawn from the images.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/rosanachehin-rgb/confocal-drift-analysis
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - quality-control
  - confocal
  - drift
  - reproducibility
authors:
